{
  "lessonId": "L2M3L3",
  "title": "Basilicata 巴西利卡塔",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad 0%,#9b59b6 100%)'><h1>🌋 Basilicata</h1><p class='subtitle'>Aglianico del Vulture 的唯一家鄉</p></section><section class='slide basilicata-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='basilicata-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='basilicata-map' class='basilicata-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌋 Basilicata 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(142,68,173,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>Monte Vulture 火山，Aglianico 的唯一家鄉</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Aglianico del Vulture Superiore</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>南義最偉大紅酒之一，5年陳年</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #8e44ad;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOC</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(142,68,173,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8e44ad'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>Aglianico del Vulture DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>基本版本，依然優美</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e67e22;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e67e22'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e67e22'>Matera DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>UNESCO世界遺產城市</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(46,204,113,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #2ecc71'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#2ecc71;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#2ecc71'>Grottino di Roccanova DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>小洞穴傳統酒窖</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏔️ 義大利最貧窮但最驕傲的產區</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Basilicata（巴西利卡塔）是義大利<strong>最貧窮、人口最稀少</strong>的大區之一，但擁有<strong>Aglianico del Vulture DOCG</strong>（南義最偉大的紅酒之一）。</p><p class='highlight'>🎯 Basilicata 葡萄酒特點：<strong>專注品質勝過數量</strong>，只有 1 個 DOCG，但國際聲譽極高。</p></div><div class='basilicata-facts'><div class='fact-item'><div class='fact-icon'>👥</div><div class='fact-value'>56 萬</div><div class='fact-label'>人口<br>（義大利倒數第四）</div></div><div class='fact-item'><div class='fact-icon'>🍷</div><div class='fact-value'>1 DOCG<br>4 DOC</div><div class='fact-label'>產區數量<br>（數量少但精）</div></div><div class='fact-item'><div class='fact-icon'>🌋</div><div class='fact-value'>火山</div><div class='fact-label'>Monte Vulture<br>已滅絕火山</div></div><div class='fact-item'><div class='fact-icon'>📉</div><div class='fact-value'>&lt; 0.3%</div><div class='fact-label'>義大利葡萄酒<br>總產量</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌋 Aglianico del Vulture DOCG</h2><div class='vulture-section'><div class='vulture-intro'><h3>👑 南義最偉大的紅酒之一</h3><p>Aglianico del Vulture（2010 年升級 DOCG）產自<strong>Monte Vulture 已滅絕火山</strong>斜坡，被認為是<strong>Aglianico 品種的最高表現</strong>，甚至超越 Campania 的 Taurasi。</p><div class='why-best'><h4>💡 為什麼 Vulture 的 Aglianico 如此優秀？</h4><div class='reasons-grid'><div class='reason'><strong>1. 火山土壤：</strong>富含礦物質、排水良好、賦予複雜度</div><div class='reason'><strong>2. 高海拔：</strong>400-700m，保留酸度和香氣</div><div class='reason'><strong>3. 日夜溫差大：</strong>白天熱、夜晚涼，延長成熟期</div><div class='reason'><strong>4. 傳統釀造：</strong>長時間浸皮、橡木桶陳年</div></div></div></div><div class='vulture-specs'><div class='spec-card'><h4>📋 規定</h4><ul><li><strong>品種：</strong>Aglianico（100%）</li><li><strong>陳年：</strong>1 年（基本款）</li><li><strong>Superiore：</strong>3 年（含 1 年橡木桶）</li><li><strong>Superiore Riserva：</strong>5 年（含 2 年橡木桶）</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12.5%+</li></ul></div><div class='spec-card'><h4>🍷 風格</h4><p><strong>年輕時（1-5 年）：</strong>深紫黑色、單寧堅硬、酸度高、需醒酒</p><p><strong>成熟期（6-15 年）：</strong>單寧軟化、石榴紅、複雜度增加</p><p><strong>陳年後（15-30 年）：</strong>優雅、細膩、皮革、煙草、焦油、玫瑰乾花、松露</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、李子、紫羅蘭、皮革、煙草、巧克力、礦物、火山灰</p></div><div class='spec-card'><h4>🌟 頂級生產者</h4><ul><li><strong>Paternoster</strong>（Don Anselmo - 標誌性酒款）</li><li><strong>Elena Fucci</strong>（Titolo - 單一園）</li><li><strong>Cantine del Notaio</strong>（Il Repertorio）</li><li><strong>D'Angelo</strong>（歷史悠久）</li><li><strong>Grifalco</strong>（現代風格）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🆚 Aglianico del Vulture vs Taurasi</h2><div class='comparison-section'><div class='comparison-intro'><h3>🤔 同一品種，兩種風格</h3><p>Aglianico del Vulture（Basilicata）和 Taurasi（Campania）都使用 Aglianico 品種，但風格有明顯差異。</p></div><table class='comparison-table'><tr><th>特徵</th><th>Aglianico del Vulture</th><th>Taurasi</th></tr><tr><td><strong>土壤</strong></td><td>火山土壤（Monte Vulture）</td><td>火山 + 石灰岩</td></tr><tr><td><strong>海拔</strong></td><td>400-700m（較高）</td><td>400-600m</td></tr><tr><td><strong>氣候</strong></td><td>更涼爽（內陸、高海拔）</td><td>較溫暖（丘陵）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風格</strong></td><td>更礦物、更優雅、更緊緻</td><td>更果香、更飽滿、更強勁</td></tr><tr><td><strong>單寧</strong></td><td>細膩、絲滑（長時陳年後）</td><td>堅實、有力（長時陳年後）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酸度</strong></td><td>高、清爽</td><td>高、明顯</td></tr><tr><td><strong>陳年潛力</strong></td><td>20-30 年</td><td>20-30 年</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格</strong></td><td>€€-€€€</td><td>€€-€€€€</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風味</strong></td><td>礦物、火山灰、松露、皮革</td><td>黑櫻桃、煙草、焦油、玫瑰</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 其他 Basilicata 葡萄酒</h2><div class='other-wines-section'><div class='wine-card'><h3>Matera DOC</h3><p class='doc-badge'>2005 年 DOC</p><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Matera 省（Basilicata 東部，靠近 Apulia）</p><p><strong>Matera：</strong>UNESCO 世界遺產城市（洞穴住宅 Sassi）</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong></p><ul><li>紅葡萄：Primitivo、Sangiovese</li><li>白葡萄：Malvasia、Greco</li></ul><p><strong>風格：</strong>比 Vulture 更溫暖、更果香、更易飲</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Grottino di Roccanova DOC</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Roccanova（Basilicata 西南部）</p><p><strong>Grottino：</strong>「小洞穴」，指傳統的洞穴酒窖</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong></p><ul><li>紅葡萄：Sangiovese、Malvasia Nera、Cabernet</li><li>白葡萄：Malvasia Bianca、Greco</li></ul><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量極小、很少在市場見到</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Terre dell'Alta Val d'Agri DOC</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Agri 河上游山谷</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong>Merlot、Cabernet、Malvasia</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>允許國際品種，現代化風格</p><p><strong>產量：</strong>極小</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Aglianico del Vulture Spumante</h2><div class='spumante-section'><div class='spumante-intro'><h3>🍾 稀有的氣泡 Aglianico</h3><p>一些生產者嘗試用 Aglianico 葡萄釀造<strong>氣泡酒（Spumante）</strong>，風格獨特、產量稀少。</p></div><div class='spumante-details'><div class='method-card'><h4>Metodo Classico（傳統法）</h4><ul><li>瓶中二次發酵（如 Champagne）</li><li>陳年 18-36 個月</li><li>風格：優雅、礦物感、細膩氣泡</li><li>風味：紅色莓果、麵包酵母、礦物</li><li>顏色：淺玫瑰粉紅</li></ul></div><div class='method-card'><h4>Metodo Charmat（槽中法）</h4><ul><li>不銹鋼槽二次發酵</li><li>更果香、更易飲</li><li>風格：清爽、果香豐富</li><li>風味：櫻桃、草莓、紫羅蘭</li></ul></div></div><div class='spumante-note'><p><strong>💡 提示：</strong>Aglianico Spumante 是葡萄酒愛好者的「隱藏寶石」，很少在國際市場見到，值得嘗試。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Basilicata 美食與配餐</h2><div class='basilicata-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🌶️ 辣椒與樸實料理</h3><p>Basilicata 料理以<strong>辣椒（Peperoncino）、羊肉、豬肉、野菜、手工義大利麵</strong>為核心，風格樸實、香料重。</p></div><div class='food-pairing-grid'><div class='food-card'><h4>🐑 Agnello al Forno</h4><p class='dish-desc'>烤羊肉（Basilicata 代表料理）</p><p><strong>調味：</strong>迷迭香、大蒜、辣椒</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Aglianico del Vulture Superiore Riserva</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🌶️ Lucanica 香腸</h4><p class='dish-desc'>辣味豬肉香腸（古羅馬時期已有）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Aglianico del Vulture（年輕版本）</li><li>Matera Primitivo</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🍝 Lagane e Ceci</h4><p class='dish-desc'>鷹嘴豆配寬麵（Basilicata 傳統麵食）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Matera Greco（白酒）</li><li>Aglianico Rosato（粉紅酒）</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🌶️ Peperoni Cruschi</h4><p class='dish-desc'>酥脆辣椒（Basilicata 特產）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>任何 Basilicata 葡萄酒</li><li>是當地餐桌必備小菜</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Basilicata 是義大利最貧窮的大區，但擁有 Aglianico del Vulture 這顆明珠</div><div class='point'>✓ Aglianico del Vulture 產自已滅絕的 Monte Vulture 火山斜坡</div><div class='point'>✓ Aglianico del Vulture 被認為是 Aglianico 品種的最高表現</div><div class='point'>✓ Superiore Riserva 需陳年 5 年，陳年潛力 20-30 年</div><div class='point'>✓ Vulture 版本比 Taurasi 更礦物、更優雅、更緊緻</div><div class='point'>✓ Basilicata 料理以辣椒和羊肉為特色</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #8e44ad;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.basilicata-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.fact-item{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9b59b6,#8e44ad);padding:25px 20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.fact-icon{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:10px}.fact-value{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.3}.fact-label{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5;opacity:.95}.vulture-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.vulture-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px}.vulture-intro h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.4rem}.vulture-intro>p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;padding:0 30px}.why-best{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:20px}.why-best h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.2rem;text-align:center}.reasons-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.reason{background:#fff;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:5px solid #8e44ad;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50}.reason strong{color:#8e44ad}.vulture-specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px;margin-top:25px}.spec-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #8e44ad}.spec-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem}.spec-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.spec-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.spec-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.comparison-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.comparison-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.comparison-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.4rem}.comparison-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.comparison-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px}.comparison-table th{background:#8e44ad;color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1.05rem}.comparison-table td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;line-height:1.6;vertical-align:top}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#fef5e7}.comparison-table strong{color:#2c3e50}.other-wines-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.wine-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid #9b59b6}.wine-card h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#9b59b6;font-size:1.2rem}.doc-badge{display:inline-block;background:#95a5a6;color:#fff;padding:5px 15px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px}.wine-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.wine-info ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.8}.wine-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.spumante-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.spumante-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fce4ec,#f8bbd0);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.spumante-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#e91e63;font-size:1.4rem}.spumante-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.spumante-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:20px}.method-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #e91e63}.method-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#e91e63;font-size:1.1rem}.method-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:25px;line-height:2}.spumante-note{background:#d5f4e6;border-left:5px solid #27ae60;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px}.spumante-note p{margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.spumante-note strong{color:#27ae60}.basilicata-cuisine{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cuisine-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cuisine-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.3rem}.cuisine-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.food-pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.food-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #d35400}.food-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.1rem}.dish-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:.95rem}.food-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.food-card ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.food-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8daef,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Aglianico del Vulture 產自哪種地質環境？",
      "options": [
        "石灰岩",
        "已滅絕火山斜坡",
        "海岸平原",
        "冰川地形"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Aglianico del Vulture 產自 Monte Vulture 已滅絕火山斜坡，火山土壤賦予獨特礦物感。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Aglianico del Vulture Superiore Riserva 需陳年多久？",
      "options": [
        "1 年",
        "3 年",
        "5 年",
        "10 年"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Aglianico del Vulture Superiore Riserva 需陳年至少 5 年（含 2 年橡木桶）才能釋出。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Aglianico del Vulture 與 Taurasi 的主要差異是？",
      "options": [
        "使用不同品種",
        "Vulture 更礦物、更優雅",
        "Taurasi 在 Basilicata",
        "酒精度差異大"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "兩者都用 Aglianico 品種，但 Vulture 因火山土壤和高海拔，風格更礦物、更優雅、更緊緻。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Basilicata 料理的特色香料是？",
      "options": [
        "羅勒",
        "辣椒（Peperoncino）",
        "番紅花",
